XX3_Aay1RckgiWLPsSWuKC0xXtGvlJhxQAQ&oe=6A68AC5C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Horror Spider Train : Hidden Escape", "keywords": ["HorrorVR", "EscapeGame", "SpiderHorror", "TrainHorror", "SurvivalHorror"], "long_description": "Step aboard the Horror Spider Train: Hidden Escape\u2026 if you dare. Darkness fills every car, the rails creak under unseen weight, and deadly spiders lurk in every shadow. Can you survive the cursed train and uncover its hidden horrors before it\u2019s too late?\nIn this thrilling VR horror adventure, every train car is a maze of secrets, traps, and terrifying surprises. Solve puzzles, evade monstrous spiders, and navigate eerie corridors as you search for a way to escape. The line between fear and reality blurs with every step.\nKey Features:\nIntense Horror: Face giant spiders and terrifying environments that will test your courage.\nHidden Adventure: Discover secret compartments and unravel the dark mysteries of the train.\nEscape the Train: Every decision matters\u2014can you survive until the last stop?\nImmersive VR Gameplay: Experience horror like never before with fully immersive VR mechanics.\nWill you survive the spider-infested rails and escape the darkness, or become another victim of the Horror Spider Train: Hidden Escape?", "short_description": "Survive the haunted rails! Escape deadly spiders and uncover hidden horrors on the cursed train."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/horizonsgames-privacy-policy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "HorizonsGames", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/horizonsgames-com/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "6443548731